Package: MutGlyph
Title: Interactive Cancer Genomics Plots
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Kari", "Lavikka", , "kari@karilavikka.fi",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-4163-4945"))
Copyright: MutGlyph package code copyright Kari Lavikka. Third-party
    components and adapted code are listed in inst/NOTICE and
    inst/JS-LICENSES.
Description: Creates opinionated, interactive cancer genomics plots from
    'maftools' mutation data and ordinary mutation tables, including oncoplots,
    protein lollipop plots, rainfall plots, and GISTIC copy-number landscapes.
    'GenomeSpy' (Lavikka et al., 2024) <doi:10.1093/gigascience/giae040>
    provides browser-based rendering, exploration, and publication-quality
    vector export. Familiar 'maftools' conventions (Mayakonda et al., 2018)
    <doi:10.1101/gr.239244.118> are retained where practical so that common
    calls require minimal changes.
